      "rationale": "Categorising free-text descriptions into issue types gives a strong grouping axis to compare resolution_minutes across category types, directly serving the query. However groundedness is undermined by clear misreads: CS-0004 (a feature enhancement request) labelled 'billing', and CS-0005 (a CSV/BOM export bug, likely data/integration) labelled 'outage'. Several samples are correct (billing, auth, outage), but the error rate on the visible sample is material."
